    "English": "'Hey, why won't you open up?!' At his loud pounding, Yasuke runs out from the back and opens the door. Looking around suspiciously as he enters, Yazaemon growls, 'Is everyone asleep already? Did you pack the sushi I ordered?'",
    "Notes": "",
    "Source": "https://kabukisk.com/yukahon11.htm",
