    "Japanese_Plain": "御詮議あらば忽ち命を取られんに、ハヽアありがたいは重盛様、「日本の金唐土へ渡すわれこそは、日の本の盗賊」と、御身の上を悔み給ひ、重ねてなんの詮議もなく、この山家へ参り鮓商売。",
    "English": "Had he investigated, I'd have lost my head on the spot—yet how noble was Lord Shigemori! Saying, \"I myself am Japan's thief for sending Japanese gold to China,\" he blamed himself and never pursued me. I moved to these mountains and opened a sushi shop.",
