    "Line_No": 43,
    "Speaker": "平維盛 (Taira no Koremori)",
    "Japanese_Ruby": "<ruby>維盛<rt>これもり</rt></ruby><ruby>枕<rt>まくら</rt></ruby>に<ruby>寄<rt>よ</rt></ruby>り<ruby>添<rt>そ</rt></ruby>ひ<ruby>給<rt>たま</rt></ruby>ひ、「これまでこそ<ruby>仮<rt>かり</rt></ruby>の<ruby>情<rt>なさ</rt></ruby>け、<ruby>夫婦<rt>ふうふ</rt></ruby>となれば<ruby>二世<rt>にせ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>緑<rt>えん</rt></ruby>。<ruby>結<rt>むす</rt></ruby>ぶに<ruby>辛<rt>つら</rt></ruby>き<ruby>一<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>つの<ruby>言<rt>い</rt></ruby>ひ<ruby>訳<rt>わけ</rt></ruby>。<ruby>何<rt>なに</rt></ruby>を<ruby>隠<rt>かく</rt></ruby>さふ<ruby>某<rt>それがし</rt></ruby>は、<ruby>国<rt>くに</rt></ruby>に<ruby>残<rt>のこ</rt></ruby>せし<ruby>妻子<rt>さいし</rt></ruby>あり、<ruby>貞女<rt>ていじょ</rt></ruby><ruby>両夫<rt>りょうふ</rt></ruby>に<ruby>見<rt>まみ</rt></ruby>へずの、<ruby>掟<rt>おきて</rt></ruby>は<ruby>夫<rt>おっと</rt></ruby>も<ruby>同<rt>おな</rt></ruby>じ<ruby>事<rt>こと</rt></ruby>。<ruby>二世<rt>にせ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>固<rt>かた</rt></ruby>めは<ruby>赦<rt>ゆる</rt></ruby>して」と、さすがに<ruby>小松<rt>こまつ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>嫡子<rt>ちゃくし</rt></ruby>とて<ruby>解<rt>と</rt></ruby>けたやうでもどこやらに、<ruby>親御<rt>おやご</rt></ruby>の<ruby>気風<rt>きふう</rt></ruby><ruby>残<rt>のこ</rt></ruby>りける。",
    "Japanese_Plain": "維盛枕に寄り添ひ給ひ、「これまでこそ仮の情け、夫婦となれば二世の緑。結ぶに辛き一つの言ひ訳。何を隠さふ某は、国に残せし妻子あり、貞女両夫に見へずの、掟は夫も同じ事。二世の固めは赦して」と、さすがに小松の嫡子とて解けたやうでもどこやらに、親御の気風残りける。",
    "English": "Drawing near her pillow, Koremori says gently, 'Until now it was a passing affection, but marriage is a bond for two lifetimes. I must make one painful confession: I have a wife and child left behind in my home province. Just as a virtuous woman serves no second husband, a husband too must keep faith. Forgive me, I cannot pledge two lifetimes.' Even in his gentleness, the upright spirit of his father Shigemori shines through.",
