    "Speaker": "弥左衛門 (Yazaemon)",
    "Japanese_Ruby": "と<ruby>語<rt>かた</rt></ruby>るにぞ、<ruby>力<rt>りき</rt></ruby>み<ruby>返<rt>かえ</rt></ruby>つて<ruby>弥左衛門<rt>やざえもん</rt></ruby>、「エヽ<ruby>聞<rt>き</rt></ruby>こえぬぞよ／＼<ruby>権太郎<rt>ごんたろう</rt></ruby>。<ruby>孫<rt>まご</rt></ruby>めに<ruby>縄<rt>なわ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>掛<rt>か</rt></ruby>ける<ruby>時<rt>とき</rt></ruby>、<ruby>血<rt>ち</rt></ruby>を<ruby>吐<rt>は</rt></ruby>く<ruby>程<rt>ほど</rt></ruby>の<ruby>悲<rt>かな</rt></ruby>しさを、<ruby>常<rt>つね</rt></ruby>に<ruby>持<rt>も</rt></ruby>つてはなぜくれぬか。<ruby>広<rt>ひろ</rt></ruby>い<ruby>世界<rt>せかい</rt></ruby>に<ruby>嫁<rt>よめ</rt></ruby><ruby>一人<rt>ひとり</rt></ruby>、<ruby>孫<rt>まご</rt></ruby>といふのもあいつ<ruby>一人<rt>ひとり</rt></ruby>ぢやはい。",
    "Japanese_Plain": "と語るにぞ、力み返つて弥左衛門、「エヽ聞こえぬぞよ／＼権太郎。孫めに縄を掛ける時、血を吐く程の悲しさを、常に持つてはなぜくれぬか。広い世界に嫁一人、孫といふのもあいつ一人ぢやはい。",
    "English": "Yazaemon cries out, trembling with grief: 'How cruel, Gontarō! If you had a heart that could feel such agony binding my grandson, why didn't you show it before? In all this wide world, she was my only daughter-in-law, and he was my only grandson!",
