    "Japanese_Plain": "人々『ハツ』と悦び涙、手負の権太這ひ出で摺り寄り、「及ばぬ智恵で梶原を、謀つたと思ふたが、あつちがなんにも皆合点。思へばこれまで衒つたも、後は命を衒らるゝ種と知らざる、浅まし」",
    "English": "Everyone sheds tears of wonder, while dying Gonta crawls forward: 'With my shallow wits I thought I'd fooled Kajiwara, when he knew everything all along! All my life of swindling was only sowing the seed to be swindled out of my own life—how pitiful!'",
